, it’s never been easier to send parcels to Israel.",[],"ltr",{"type":89,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":92},"Shipping to Israel from the UK takes between 7 and 10 days to arrive with your recipient. We also deliver to over 200+ international destinations, including neighbouring countries in the Middle East and beyond.",[96,103],{"start":97,"end":98,"type":99,"data":100},187,198,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":101,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fafrica-and-the-middle-east","_blank",{"start":97,"end":98,"type":104},"strong","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":108,"version":109,"items":110,"primary":111,"id":136,"slice_type":137,"slice_label":46},"default","initial",[],{"theme":112,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":46,"label_theme":113,"title":114,"image":115,"image_position_right":20,"content":123,"button_primary":130,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":134,"secondary_button_external":20},"standard","Core","Middle East Service Update",{"dimensions":116,"alt":118,"copyright":46,"url":119,"id":120,"edit":121},{"width":78,"height":117},665,"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&w=1000&h=665","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":66,"y":122,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,[124],{"type":89,"text":125,"spans":126,"direction":92},"As a result of the situation in the middle east, international services to UAE, Bahrain, Kuwait, Israel, Lebanon and Qatar are facing significant delays. Any shipments in transit to these destinations will be accepted and held until it is clear to send them.",[127],{"start":128,"end":129,"type":104},75,123,{"link_type":36,"key":131,"url":132,"text":133},"fc94a187-c271-4540-af6b-8a0585985877","israel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fservice-status","Check Service Status",{"link_type":135},"Any","landing_feature_banner2$63b6557d-d148-4707-867b-59f7c8b6327f","landing_feature_banner2",{"variation":139,"version":31,"items":140,"primary":156,"id":165,"slice_type":166,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[141,144,147,150,153],{"Col1Content":142,"Col2Content":143},"250g","£12.99",{"Col1Content":145,"Col2Content":146},"500g","£16.29",{"Col1Content":148,"Col2Content":149},"1kg","£22.19",{"Col1Content":151,"Col2Content":152},"2kg","£26.89",{"Col1Content":154,"Col2Content":155},"5kg+","£40.19",{"SectionTitle":157,"SectionSubtitle":158,"Col1Header":159,"Col2Header":160,"InformationTableButtonUrl":161,"InformationTableButtonText":164,"isTableShort":20},"Cost of shipping to Israel from the UK","When you send packages to Israel, you can be sure you’re getting a great service at a low price with Evri. You can send parcels up to 15kg, with £20 parcel cover and full tracking included as standard.","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":162,"url":163},"7ed73dfd-86b4-4832-a461-a86d6fbfaebe","israel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Israel","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":169,"primary":170,"id":227,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":171,"CardText":172,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":226,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in Israel",[173,176,182,187,191,196,201,206,210,214,218,223],{"type":89,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":92},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":177,"text":178,"spans":179,"direction":92},"list-item","Tu Bishvat - 02\u002F02\u002F2026",[180],{"start":66,"end":181,"type":104},10,{"type":177,"text":183,"spans":184,"direction":92},"Purim - 02\u002F03\u002F2026 - 04\u002F03\u002F2026",[185],{"start":66,"end":186,"type":104},6,{"type":177,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":92},"Passover - 01\u002F04\u002F2026- 08\u002F04\u002F2026",[190],{"start":66,"end":122,"type":104},{"type":177,"text":192,"spans":193,"direction":92},"Yom Ha’atzmaut - 22\u002F04\u002F2026",[194],{"start":66,"end":195,"type":104},14,{"type":177,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":92},"Shavuot - 21\u002F05\u002F2026 - 22\u002F05\u002F2026",[199],{"start":66,"end":200,"type":104},7,{"type":177,"text":202,"spans":203,"direction":92},"Rosh Hashanah - 11\u002F09\u002F2026 - 13\u002F09\u002F2026",[204],{"start":66,"end":205,"type":104},13,{"type":177,"text":207,"spans":208,"direction":92},"Yom Kippur - 20\u002F09\u002F2026 - 21\u002F09\u002F2026",[209],{"start":66,"end":181,"type":104},{"type":177,"text":211,"spans":212,"direction":92},"Sukkot - 25\u002F09\u002F2026 - 02\u002F10\u002F2026",[213],{"start":66,"end":200,"type":104},{"type":177,"text":215,"spans":216,"direction":92},"Simchat Torah – 03\u002F10\u002F2026",[217],{"start":66,"end":205,"type":104},{"type":177,"text":219,"spans":220,"direction":92},"Hanukkah – 05\u002F12\u002F2026 - 12\u002F12\u002F2026",[221],{"start":66,"end":222,"type":104},9,{"type":89,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":92},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":135},"card$14b2e986-5c45-4286-b351-eed57831b043",{"variation":229,"version":31,"items":230,"primary":292,"id":302,"slice_type":303,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[231,252,271],{"Title":232,"Description":237,"Image":241,"Label":46,"UrlText":235,"Url":248,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":251,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[233],{"type":234,"text":235,"spans":236},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[238],{"type":89,"text":239,"spans":240,"direction":92},"Book your delivery online and drop off at one of our 9,000+ local ParcelShops. No printer? No problem. You can print your label using our free Print in ParcelShop devices. We're also in 3,000+ Post Offices if you'd prefer to book your parcel in person.",[],{"dimensions":242,"alt":243,"copyright":46,"url":244,"id":245,"edit":246},{"width":78,"height":117},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":247,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},462,{"link_type":36,"key":249,"url":250},"04b11671-2152-4ec6-8076-654b8f0a63b4","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":135},{"Title":253,"Description":257,"Image":261,"Label":46,"UrlText":255,"Url":267,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":270,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[254],{"type":234,"text":255,"spans":256},"Lockers",[],[258],{"type":89,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":92},"Book your international parcel online. Simply scan your barcode and drop your package off at one of our convenient and secure Lockers ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":262,"alt":263,"copyright":46,"url":264,"id":265,"edit":266},{"width":78,"height":117},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":66,"y":122,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":268,"url":269},"e6db6871-e070-4443-95d7-68273ecaca77","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":135},{"Title":272,"Description":276,"Image":280,"Label":46,"UrlText":287,"Url":288,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":291,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[273],{"type":234,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":92},"Courier collection",[],[277],{"type":89,"text":278,"spans":279,"direction":92},"Arrange for a courier collection from your home or office on a convenient day for you. We'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us to arrive.",[],{"dimensions":281,"alt":282,"copyright":46,"url":283,"id":284,"edit":285},{"width":78,"height":117},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=26%2C0%2C7672%2C5102&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw",{"x":286,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},26,"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":289,"url":290},"150be1b2-bd54-4688-af7a-0af07eed8641","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":135},{"SectionTitle":293,"SectionDescription":298,"theme":46},[294],{"type":295,"text":296,"spans":297},"heading2","How to send parcels to Israel",[],[299],{"type":89,"text":300,"spans":301},"With Evri, you can send parcels to Israel from the UK using three different methods:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":305,"version":31,"items":306,"primary":308,"id":335,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[307],{},{"CardImage":309,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":315,"CardText":316,"ButtonText":332,"ButtonUrl":333,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":310,"alt":311,"copyright":46,"url":312,"id":313,"edit":314},{"width":78,"height":117},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":66,"y":122,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Sending multiple parcels to Israel",[317,320,323,326,329],{"type":89,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":92},"Using our bulk integrations tool makes sending multiple international parcels in one go quicker and easier. ",[],{"type":89,"text":321,"spans":322,"direction":92},"1. Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":89,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":92},"2. Package up your items and book your parcels in one go",[],{"type":89,"text":327,"spans":328,"direction":92},"3. Print off your postage label at home ",[],{"type":89,"text":330,"spans":331,"direction":92},"4. Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":334,"url":38},"e1246296-2107-4ab3-a040-bb361e425f0d","card$9415eb88-416f-4586-bb8f-fce73cf332fc",{"variation":337,"version":31,"items":338,"primary":418,"id":420,"slice_type":421,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[339,358,370,382,394,406],{"title":340,"content":341,"icon":351},"Regular tracking updates",[342],{"type":89,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[345,350],{"start":346,"end":347,"type":99,"data":348},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":349,"target":102},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":346,"end":347,"type":104},{"dimensions":352,"alt":354,"copyright":46,"url":355,"id":356,"edit":357},{"width":353,"height":353},40,"Phone icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":359,"content":360,"icon":364},"Parcel cover",[361],{"type":89,"text":362,"spans":363,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":365,"alt":366,"copyright":46,"url":367,"id":368,"edit":369},{"width":353,"height":353},"Money icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":371,"content":372,"icon":376},"Customs made easier",[373],{"type":89,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":377,"alt":378,"copyright":46,"url":379,"id":380,"edit":381},{"width":353,"height":353},"Passport icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":383,"content":384,"icon":388},"Flexible printing options",[385],{"type":89,"text":386,"spans":387,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":389,"alt":390,"copyright":46,"url":391,"id":392,"edit":393},{"width":353,"height":353},"Printer icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":395,"content":396,"icon":400},"Bulk Send",[397],{"type":89,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our Bulk Send tool",[],{"dimensions":401,"alt":402,"copyright":46,"url":403,"id":404,"edit":405},{"width":353,"height":353},"Laptop icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":407,"content":408,"icon":412},"Trusted by top UK brands",[409],{"type":89,"text":410,"spans":411,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":413,"alt":414,"copyright":46,"url":415,"id":416,"edit":417},{"width":353,"height":353},"Success icon","israel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":112,"title":419,"description":46},"Why send parcels to Israel with Evri?","list_block$d93dfbb9-615c-4e88-8b6f-2dd915135f48","list_block",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":423,"primary":425,"id":452,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":46},[424],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":426,"CardText":427,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":451,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Israel",[428,436],{"type":89,"text":429,"spans":430,"direction":92},"While you can send various items to Israel with Evri, there are a few exceptions. You’ll find a full breakdown of what you can and can’t send on our prohibited items list. ",[431,435],{"start":432,"end":433,"type":99,"data":434},149,170,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":102},{"start":432,"end":433,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":92},"You should also follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to stay on top of the latest restrictions for sending parcels to Israel via airlines.",[439,444,445,450],{"start":440,"end":441,"type":99,"data":442},27,59,{"link_type":36,"url":443,"target":102},"israel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":440,"end":441,"type":104},{"start":446,"end":447,"type":99,"data":448},68,95,{"link_type":36,"url":449,"target":102},"israel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":446,"end":447,"type":104},{"link_type":135},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":305,"version":31,"items":454,"primary":456,"id":471,"slice_type":472,"slice_label":46},[455],{},{"title":457,"bodyText":458,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":462,"buttonText":164,"buttonLink":463,"image":465},"Customs",[459],{"type":89,"text":460,"spans":461,"direction":92},"When you send a parcel internationally with us, we do all the hard work for you. There's no need to worry about filling in a customs form; all you need to do is fill in the contents information online, and we will take care of the rest.",[],true,{"link_type":36,"key":464,"url":163},"715ad9e0-1d6d-4324-8452-f4d28e8ef598",{"dimensions":466,"alt":467,"copyright":46,"url":468,"id":469,"edit":470},{"width":78,"height":117},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","israel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":66,"y":122,"zoom":67,"background":68},"feature_banner$40a26ff1-2d4d-4eac-b78c-ea14a35c834a","feature_banner",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":474,"primary":476,"id":518,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":46},[475],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":477,"CardText":478,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":517,"IsEco":20},"Address format for sending parcels to Israel",[479,482,485,488,491,494,497,501,505,510,514],{"type":89,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":92},"When you send a parcel to Israel, you’ll need to follow   the correct address structure:",[],{"type":177,"text":483,"spans":484,"direction":92},"The recipient’s name",[],{"type":177,"text":486,"spans":487,"direction":92},"The house number and street name",[],{"type":177,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":92},"The postcode and city",[],{"type":177,"text":492,"spans":493,"direction":92},"ISRAEL in capital letters on the last line of the address",[],{"type":89,"text":495,"spans":496,"direction":92},"For example:",[],{"type":89,"text":498,"spans":499,"direction":92},"Ms J. Doe",[500],{"start":66,"end":222,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":502,"spans":503,"direction":92},"28 Jafa Street",[504],{"start":66,"end":195,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":506,"spans":507,"direction":92},"9382072 Tel Aviv",[508],{"start":66,"end":509,"type":104},16,{"type":89,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":92},"ISRAEL",[513],{"start":66,"end":186,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":515,"spans":516,"direction":92},"If you don't write the address correctly, your parcel may be returned to you without a delivery attempt. With Evri, we’ll ensure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label.",[],{"link_type":135},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":305,"version":31,"items":520,"primary":554,"id":556,"slice_type":557,"slice_label":46},[521,542],{"questionTitle":522,"questionBody":523},"Is there import tax from the UK to Israel?",[524,527,530,533],{"type":89,"text":525,"spans":526,"direction":92},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":89,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":92},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":89,"text":531,"spans":532,"direction":92},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":89,"text":534,"spans":535,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[536,541],{"start":537,"end":538,"type":99,"data":539},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":540,"target":102},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":537,"end":538,"type":104},{"questionTitle":543,"questionBody":544},"Can I track my international parcels?",[545],{"type":89,"text":546,"spans":547,"direction":92},"Yes, your international parcel can be tracked at every stage of the journey. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on ou